X-WR-CALNAME:WuWa - Version Calendar
X-WR-CALDESC:Only Wuthering Waves previews and version updates. Leaving a g
 ame? On iPhone just delete that calendar. On Android\, switch OFF "show" i
 n Calendar account settings instead of tapping Delete - deleting one URL s
 ubscription removes all of them.
X-WR-TIMEZONE:Asia/Shanghai
REFRESH-INTERVAL;VALUE=DURATION:PT6H
X-PUBLISHED-TTL:PT6H
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:wuwa-38-preview@game-version-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261102T120000Z
DTSTART:20261106T110000Z
DTEND:20261106T123000Z
SUMMARY:Wuthering Waves 3.8 Preview Broadcast
DESCRIPTION:Official livestream. Covers the 3.8 convene banners and the new
  5-star\, plus three codes worth 300 Astrite.\n\nCodes expire at Nov 08\, 
 23:59 (UTC+8)\, 23:59 on day 2 after the stream - 53 hours after the strea
 m ends.\n\nAll times are Beijing time (UTC+8).\nEntries marked Estimated o
 r TBC are projected from version cycles and may shift once officially anno
 unced.
LOCATION:Wuthering Waves - Official stream
CATEGORIES:Wuthering Waves
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT30M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Special Program starts in 30 minutes
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
