DTSTAMP:20261102T120000Z
DTSTART:20261108T155900Z
DTEND:20261108T161400Z
SUMMARY:WuWa 3.8 - Redemption codes expire (Computed)
DESCRIPTION:Valid 53 hours: stream starts Nov 06\, 19:00\, codes die Nov 08
 \, 23:59 (UTC+8).\n\nThree codes worth 300 Astrite total.\nOnce they expir
 e they are gone - no reissues\, no appeals.\n\nRedeem in game under Settin
 gs > Other Settings (wrench icon) > Redeem.\nMissed the stream? The VOD de
 scription and the official preview page usually list all three codes.\n\nA
 ll times are Beijing time (UTC+8).\nEntries marked Estimated or TBC are pr
 ojected from version cycles and may shift once officially announced.
LOCATION:Wuthering Waves - Redemption page
CATEGORIES:Wuthering Waves
STATUS:CONFIRMED
